  "title": "Lemon Curd Bars with Coconut",
  "description": "This bar has the two crusts as requested, and has a strong tangy lemon taste, so much better than most of the lemon bar recipes out there due to the lemon curd and added coconut!",
  "authors": [
    "THEA"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-05-03T02:33:09-04:00",
